# Git Repository for FC Verachtert Wedstrijdtracker

## Installation & Setup

1. Install dependencies:
```bash
cd backend && npm install
cd ../frontend && npm install
```

2. Create `.env` file from `.env.example`:
```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

3. Configure environment variables:
- Add Supabase URL and API key
- Add Google Calendar iCal URL
- Generate JWT_SECRET

4. Set up Supabase database:
- Create free account at supabase.com
- Run SQL schema: `backend/db/schema.sql`

5. Start development servers:
```bash
# Terminal 1 - Backend
cd backend && npm run dev

# Terminal 2 - Frontend  
cd frontend && npm run dev
```

## Project Structure

### Backend (`/backend`)
- `server.js` - Express app entry point
- `routes/` - API endpoints (matches, players, calendar, auth)
- `middleware/` - Authentication & authorization
- `db/` - Database schema and migrations
- `.env.example` - Environment variables template

### Frontend (`/frontend`)
- `src/pages/` - Page components (Dashboard, Login, AdminPanel, etc)
- `src/utils/` - Helper functions
- `index.html` - HTML entry point
- `vite.config.js` - Vite config
- `tailwind.config.js` - Tailwind CSS config

## API Endpoints

### Auth
- `POST /api/auth/register` - Create admin account
- `POST /api/auth/login` - Login

### Matches
- `GET /api/matches` - Get all matches
- `GET /api/matches/:id` - Get match details
- `GET /api/matches/:id/appearances` - Get player stats for match
- `POST /api/matches` - Create match (admin)
- `PUT /api/matches/:id` - Update match (admin)
- `POST /api/matches/:id/appearances` - Save appearances (admin)

### Players
- `GET /api/players` - Get all active players
- `GET /api/players/stats` - Get season statistics
- `POST /api/players` - Add player (admin)
- `PUT /api/players/:id` - Update player (admin)

### Calendar
- `POST /api/calendar/sync` - Sync Google Calendar
- `GET /api/calendar/events` - Get calendar events
- `PUT /api/calendar/:eventId/mark-as-match` - Toggle event as match

## Development Notes

- Database queries are marked with `TODO` comments - implement Supabase calls
- Auth endpoints return mock data - integrate with Supabase auth
- Frontend uses `localStorage` for auth tokens in development
- All API errors should return consistent error format

